WEBVTT

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:20.060
Ah, with this I will finally have you, beautiful blue-eyed one.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.570
As long as I have this jade from a dragon's neck,

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.060
you will be mine.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.470
Don't fall behind, Kintoki!

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.110
What is going on?!

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.690
Hey, now. What is...

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:56.220
Oh, how can this be?

00:00:57.730 --> 00:00:59.200
You are...

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:04.140
I never thought you would come to greet me.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:11.770
Oh, blue-eyed princess, Kaguya.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.330
Where is Seimei?!

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:25.460
Right here!

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.430
Is it true that Horrors have been targeting aristocrats?

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:30.830
Of course. Trust me.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.600
We were too late.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.300
Looks like it.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.570
This is...

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.350
Kintoki!

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:50.580
A Horror!

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:53.130
Come!

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.060
She's the one.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:09.830
The cursed princess that the capital has been talking about.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.780
Kaguya.

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:48.940
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:56.920
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:04.160
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:13.190
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:22.540
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:30.390
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:38.320
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:48.330
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:54.440
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:59.010
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:04.010
"KAGUYA"

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.590
Sanukino Miyatsukomaro.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:11.260
An old bamboo cutter that lived in the mountains

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:14.730
is now the master of this great mansion.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:19.570
I heard that some men have paid for hundreds of tickets to meet her.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:23.530
Yeah, it's true. See the Middle Counselor there?

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.240
Such exorbitant spending.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.910
I've heard that she's given tasks to her suitors.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.450
In the end, only the rich get everything.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:36.080
Hey, now. They might overhear.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.850
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:45.160
I finally obtained one!
A ticket to meet her face-to-face!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.590
Good job.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:54.300
"Now that the moment has come to don the celestial robe..."

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.610
Why is there a poem on the ticket to see her?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.870
The police magistrate was being picky.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:06.040
Officially, the poems are what they sell and the chance to meet her is a bonus.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.180
Is that how it is?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:15.560
The line is barely moving forward.
At this rate the sun will set.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:19.020
Patience is important for something like this.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.970
Have you come to save me?

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.910
Don't just zone off!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.840
That woman is the Horror.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.340
Kaguya<i>-sama</i>!

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:36.640
What is going on?!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.310
Are you all right? What happened?!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.820
Kaguya! Dear Kaguya!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.510
How could this happen?

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:49.060
This is Ootomono Miyuki-<i>sama</i>! How terrible!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.990
What happened here?

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.260
It was the work of an evil spirit.

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:59.500
Though we ran over and the spirit did not have a chance to eat him.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.870
Oh! So the two of you saved my daughter!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.210
Oh! Thank you so very much!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.110
Thank goodness. Thank goodness.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:14.050
At this rate, the sun will set.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:15.420
You're right.

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:18.750
Though you can meet her, she is a princess.

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.590
At most, you'll be able to see her through a bamboo curtain.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.760
I'll have Kintoki check to see if she is a Horror.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:28.800
I never thought the woman-hating
Raiko would be so easily deceived.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.470
What are you saying?!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:35.270
The one who stands here is Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:41.670
There is no way he would be deceived by a woman!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.310
Raiko-<i>sama</i> is a noble man!

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:47.650
He has distanced himself from women for the sake of his duty!

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:56.090
His heart is golden and his body is as pure as the first snow!

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:58.330
He is truly pure!

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.930
Kintoki, that isn't a compliment.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.130
Huh?

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.130
Seimei, please explain what you've heard.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:11.070
The first suitor, Abeno Mimuraji, was completely head over heels for Kaguya.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:15.810
He finally obtained the item that was requested for marriage

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:19.010
and as he rushed to Kaguya's residence...

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.480
According to the servants of the house,

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:27.260
Abeno Mimuraji's body was cut in two and an evil spirit

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:30.630
consumed his soul as his flesh burned up in flames.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.930
How terrible.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:35.100
The worst kind of death.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:39.470
The death of the second suitor,
Ishizukurino Miko,

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.230
was witnessed by
Negi priests of the Shinto shrine.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:48.040
According to them, Ishizukurino Miko was crushed under a sacred <i>shintai</i>

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:51.980
and eaten while he was immobile.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:57.890
The objects required for her hand in marriage were both taken.

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:02.220
Ootomono Miyuki last night was the third suitor.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.920
This definitely isn't the work of a human.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.000
Did Kaguya really do all of that?

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:17.310
The treasures that were taken are all rarest among the rare!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:21.710
Using her womanly wiles like that!
That Kaguya makes me sick!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.980
Hm? I feel you are similar in that regard...

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.650
Ouch!

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:30.220
If Kaguya is a Horror, I will cut her down.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:31.810
That is my duty.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:37.830
Next guest, please come this way.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.120
You must pay just to see her face.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:44.030
To top it off, she steals the treasures from her suitors.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:46.770
Princess Kaguya is truly a terrible woman.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:49.500
She must be skilled at deceiving men.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.940
Men are weak to women.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.740
Well, that has nothing to do with Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.080
You're all in the way!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:02.780
Open a path! Open a path for Marotari-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:04.520
Stand down! Stand down!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.620
You pathetic men, who use what little money you have

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:12.030
to buy tickets just to see Kaguya's face.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.960
I truly pity all of you.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.800
Even riffraff have managed to sneak in tonight.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.110
The chance to meet the princess ends here tonight!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:35.750
I have brought the swallow's cowrie shell that the princess requested.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.120
I, Isonokamino Marotari,

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:42.620
will now move forward with the talk of marriage.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:47.330
Wait! Stop the talk of marriage!

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.630
That man is also a suitor.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:52.570
There are five all together.
He is the fifth suitor.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:56.770
Well, if it isn't Kuramochino Miko.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:58.820
You don't even have your servants with you.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:04.340
It looks like you don't even have the treasure she requested with you.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.410
I can't believe you even showed your face here!

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:13.150
I-I will never hand Kaguya over to a filthy man as you!

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.520
How insolent!

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.620
You bastard!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:22.760
Go!

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.030
Kaguya!

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.670
You are?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.640
I am Raiko.

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.130
From last night.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:42.020
I was waiting for you, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.020
Catch them! Catch them!

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:44.820
Kintoki!

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:46.010
Yes!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.120
Who the hell is this?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:53.960
Raiko-<i>sama</i>. Please save this Kaguya.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.830
Save you?

00:10:57.230 --> 00:11:00.900
Who are you?! Get away from Kaguya-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:03.970
This place is dangerous. Let's escape.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.410
Kintoki! I leave the rest to you!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.340
Yes!

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:09.870
Wait, what?

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:12.980
They escaped! After them!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.830
Can you stand on your own?

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:40.510
I'm sorry.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.840
Why are you apologizing?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:48.580
Though it was for the sake of running away, I treated you roughly.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.950
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.920
No, I'm not really...

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.690
Are you awake?

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:24.280
A Makai Knight such as myself fell off a cliff?!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.840
Shit. Just how careless could I be?

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:35.260
I am here to check if you are a Horror or not.

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.360
Horror?

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.930
An evil spirit.

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:41.230
They are attracted to the negativity of men and consume them.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:44.990
Kaguya, you're not a Horror, are you?

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:48.130
You are the man who will save me.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.070
Kaguya.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.380
I heard from my father.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:07.220
I was born from a bamboo stalk.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.920
What a strange story.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:13.930
But I do not remember anything myself.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.400
I only remember two things.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:21.970
The first, I have come here from the moon.

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:28.740
The second, someone will come to bring me salvation one day.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:34.010
Just what do you want to be saved from?

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.180
Horrors?

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:40.860
Then, why did you request treasures from your suitors?!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:44.290
Why did you do something that would attract Horrors?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:48.160
I did not request them.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.870
Before I realized it, they began to compete with each other

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:55.040
using rarer and more valuable items.

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.640
So someone wanted you so badly that they would kill the other suitors

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:01.610
and steal the treasures from them.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.400
That man's desire called forth a Horror.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:07.550
How terrifying.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.410
Only two suitors are still alive.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:14.540
Isonokamino Marotari and Kuramochino Miko.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.320
One of them is a Horror.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:19.950
I feel bad for everyone.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:27.470
I see. So?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.910
Like I said, Kaguya isn't a Horror.
The remaining two suitors must...!

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.580
At the very least, Marotari isn't a Horror.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.340
How do you know?

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:41.250
A Horror appeared while you were escaping with Kaguya, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.220
What happened to that Horror?

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:46.690
It cut Isonokamino Marotari in two.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.820
He wasn't eaten because of the servants nearby,

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.660
but the treasure was taken.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.900
What about Kuramochino Miko?

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:57.040
He pulled out his sword and rampaged.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.230
In the end, the police magistrate caught him.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.840
I see! So the Horror must have been Kuramochino Miko!

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.240
No!

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.170
Kaguya is the Horror.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:14.010
I can tell just by looking at you.
You're completely taken with her!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.890
Kaguya was with me.
How could she kill Marotari?!

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:22.360
Were you together with her the entire time?

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:25.360
I will go to the prison and meet with Kuramochino Miko!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.760
Kintoki! We're going to go and check to see if he is a Horror!

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.070
Yes! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.400
I'm coming, too.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:40.810
So noisy.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.370
Something is coming this way.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.900
Hurry! Hurry!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.880
Don't hold back!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:53.590
Kuramochino Miko!
Be sure to find and capture him!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.890
I do not care if a man who cuts down a guard comes back alive or dead!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.430
They're frantic.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:03.260
So Kuramochino Miko was a Horror, after all. Kaguya is in danger.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.940
It seems he has returned to his own house.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.770
Why?

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.500
We'll have to go and see.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.680
This is truly a sea of blood.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:25.750
The jeweled branch of Hourai...

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.920
It is a treasured heirloom of this family.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.660
I can't believe he killed his own parents.

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:37.600
He killed his father and stole the treasure. He is definitely a Horror!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.830
The next place Kuramochino Miko would go...

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.180
Kaguya's house.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.320
Bring out Kaguya!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:16:59.950
I am here.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.190
Kaguya!

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:03.660
Don't come out! Run away!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:09.230
This is all my fault, isn't it?

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:15.070
Kaguya, look. This is the treasured jeweled branch of Hourai.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:21.410
But I killed my father, my servants, and the police magistrate.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:28.720
I killed many people. This is the end.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.480
Kaguya.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.360
--Die with me!
--Please stop!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.820
Stop!

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:38.890
Kintoki!

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:40.490
Understood!

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.330
Both of them aren't Horrors!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.040
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Them!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.340
It can't be...

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.170
You two were the Horrors?!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:18.900
I never thought the men who wanted Kaguya would go this crazy.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:22.800
The desire for the treasures called forth the Horrors!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:27.980
I found Kaguya in a bamboo stalk.
I won't hand her over to anyone!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:31.210
We won't let her go!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.580
I will cut you down.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:41.820
It smells. I can smell it!
The delicious smell of a soul!

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:46.130
Two Horrors?!

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:49.800
I see. That's why the way the people were killed were different!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.470
How careless of us!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.400
Seimei!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.600
The seal!

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:54.830
Yes.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.610
Zaruba!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:17.680
You ate up all the men in love with the blue-eyed princess.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.390
You must be punished for that crime!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.330
It's no use!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.810
They are an amalgamation of desire.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.540
It's not over yet.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:12.510
Understood!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:57.260
I believed that they were the ones who raised me for a long time.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:21:00.860
But, I was wrong.

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:04.060
That's why I cut them down.

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:06.100
That isn't it.

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.730
What isn't it?

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:13.110
It wasn't you, either.
The redemption I was waiting for.

00:21:13.110 --> 00:21:15.960
Why? How do you know it's not me?

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.430
I do not know.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.980
It is time to say farewell.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:28.850
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:31.930
Kaguya.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.220
Kaguya!

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.250
Kaguya...

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:00.490
Aw, she left.

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:03.460
She wasn't a normal human, after all.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:09.680
Kaguya.

00:22:31.220 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:45.260
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:52.340
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:02.850
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.850 --> 00:23:06.320
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.420
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:12.060
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:16.830
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:23.790
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:30.210
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:37.450
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:40.750
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.750 --> 00:23:48.460
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:51.070 --> 00:24:01.080
"Next Episode: HAKAMADARE"

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.940
A small wish.

00:23:54.940 --> 00:23:56.910
Is that a sin?

00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:00.210
What becomes of the intersecting feelings?
